  "prefLabel": "Rev 2007.01 Timeliness",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 2007.01 Timeliness.\n\n(a) All forms and reports shall be filed in accordance with:\n\n(1) RSA 21-J:34;\n\n(2) Statutes addressing specific reports; or\n\n(3) Time periods established by these rules.\n\nSource. #5454, eff 8-28-92; ss by #6809, eff 7-21-98; ss by #8686, eff 7-21-06; ss by #10675, eff 9-24-14 (formerly Rev 2008.02); ss by #14072, eff 9-10-24 (formerly Rev 2007.02)",
